        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Key Blank: right-click to enter the key-matching minigame. Fault tolerance fixed at 5; matching costs Inspiration, with the progress cost matching the chosen difficulty (2/3/4/7/8/9).",
            "zh_cn": "钥胚：右键进入配钥小游戏。容错次数固定为5次；配钥匙需要消耗灵感，进度需求与所选难度灵感消耗一致（2/3/4/7/8/9）。",
            "zh_tw": "鑰胚：右鍵進入配鑰小遊戲。容錯次數固定為5次；配鑰匙需要消耗靈感，進度需求與所選難度靈感消耗一致（2/3/4/7/8/9）。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.7,
            6.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "A key blank can make the following items (easiest to hardest): Attendant Key, Iron Door Key, Crowbar, Skeleton Key, Lockpick, Artisan Key",
            "zh_cn": "钥胚可以配出以下道具(难度由易到难)：乘务员钥匙、铁门钥匙、撬棍、万能钥匙、开锁器、巧匠钥匙",
            "zh_tw": "鑰胚可以配出以下道具(難度由易到難)：乘務員鑰匙、鐵門鑰匙、撬棍、萬能鑰匙、開鎖器、巧匠鑰匙"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            3.15,
            6.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Paperclip: one-use door opener; directly opens doors not counter-locked by a lockpick; can be thrown.",
            "zh_cn": "回形针：一次性开门道具，可直接打开未被撬锁器反锁的门，可以丢出。",
            "zh_tw": "迴紋針：一次性開門道具，可直接打開未被撬鎖器反鎖的門，可以丟出。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            3.6,
            6.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Artisan Key: opens doors ignoring items on them and lockpick counter-locks, without breaking the Engineer's reinforced items; does not drop on death.",
            "zh_cn": "巧匠钥匙：可无视门上的道具与撬锁器反锁直接开门，不会破坏门上工程师的加固道具，死亡时不会掉落。",
            "zh_tw": "巧匠鑰匙：可無視門上的道具與撬鎖器反鎖直接開門，不會破壞門上工程師的加固道具，死亡時不會掉落。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            4.05,
            6.0
